                    <div class="n2-ss-slide-backgrounds n2-ow-all"><div class="n2-ss-slide-background" data-public-id="1" data-mode="fill"><div data-color="RGBA(255,255,255,1)" style="background-color: RGBA(255,255,255,1);" class="n2-ss-slide-background-color"></div></div><div class="n2-ss-slide-background" data-public-id="2" data-mode="fill" aria-hidden="true"><div data-color="RGBA(255,255,255,1)" style="background-color: RGBA(255,255,255,1);" class="n2-ss-slide-background-color"></div></div><div class="n2-ss-slide-background" data-public-id="3" data-mode="fill" aria-hidden="true"><div data-color="RGBA(255,255,255,1)" style="background-color: RGBA(255,255,255,1);" class="n2-ss-slide-background-color"></div></div><div class="n2-ss-slide-background" data-public-id="4" data-mode="fill" aria-hidden="true"><div data-color="RGBA(255,255,255,1)" style="background-color: RGBA(255,255,255,1);" class="n2-ss-slide-background-color"></div></div><div class="n2-ss-slide-background" data-public-id="5" data-mode="fill" aria-hidden="true"><div data-color="RGBA(255,255,255,1)" style="background-color: RGBA(255,255,255,1);" class="n2-ss-slide-background-color"></div></div></div>                    <div class="n2-ss-slider-4 n2-ow">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1200 300" data-related-device="desktopPortrait" class="n2-ow n2-ss-preserve-size n2-ss-preserve-size--slider n2-ss-slide-limiter"></svg><div data-first="1" data-slide-duration="0" data-id="5" data-slide-public-id="1" data-title="Slide" class="n2-ss-slide n2-ow  n2-ss-slide-5"><div role="note" class="n2-ss-slide--focus" tabindex="-1">Slide</div><div class="n2-ss-layers-container n2-ss-slide-limiter n2-ow"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-OsZc6vVlPnuc" data-sstype="slide" data-pm="default"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-N1lm3dWZxcdl" data-pm="default" data-sstype="content" data-hasbackground="1"><div class="n2-ss-section-main-content n2-ss-layer-with-background n2-ss-layer-content n2-ow n-uc-N1lm3dWZxcdl-inner"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-R7XiUfrzDlVx" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div class="n2-ss-item-content n2-ss-text n2-ow-all"><div class=""><p class="n2-font-48ca1d67608e07a2ee6350a1d5e3fbd2-paragraph   ">&#8220;Our Emiratisation objectives were only possible because of Raad Recruitment. Their dedicated Emirati specialist quickly identified top talent, and their guidance ensured an effortless onboarding process. I highly recommend Raad for successfully navigating emiratisation.&#8221;</p>
</div></div></div><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-6iroVly0qUAl" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div class=" n2-ss-item-image-content n2-ss-item-content n2-ow-all"><img decoding="async" id="n2-ss-3item2" alt="person image" class="skip-lazy" style="width:100px;height:90px" data-skip-lazy="1" src="//raadrecruitment.ae/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Female-01.png" /></div></div><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-ulLvH5SlC7pL" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div id="n2-ss-3item3" class="n2-font-b77b80bbaf8ee8b18ad5234bcba03fe7-hover n2-style-b0eb591498834a1e131eda9c9265d3d2-heading   n2-ss-item-content n2-ss-text n2-ow" style="display:block;">Sarah Ahmed, Marketing Manager</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-slide-duration="0" data-id="6" data-slide-public-id="2" aria-hidden="true" data-title="Slide" class="n2-ss-slide n2-ow  n2-ss-slide-6"><div role="note" class="n2-ss-slide--focus" tabindex="-1">Slide</div><div class="n2-ss-layers-container n2-ss-slide-limiter n2-ow"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-O7zqq2LQoUsy" data-sstype="slide" data-pm="default"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-KTdlEbKDef8W" data-pm="default" data-sstype="content" data-hasbackground="1"><div class="n2-ss-section-main-content n2-ss-layer-with-background n2-ss-layer-content n2-ow n-uc-KTdlEbKDef8W-inner"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-CHHSuCLkzpUB" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div class="n2-ss-item-content n2-ss-text n2-ow-all"><div class=""><p class="n2-font-48ca1d67608e07a2ee6350a1d5e3fbd2-paragraph   ">&#8220;My company worked with Raad&#8217;s staff outsourcing for our customer service team. Their experienced professionals gathered qualified candidates who matched our culture. Raad&#8217;s ongoing support keeps things running smoothly and allows us to focus on growth without any hurdles&#8221;</p>
</div></div></div><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-n37YNDl82hxf" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div class=" n2-ss-item-image-content n2-ss-item-content n2-ow-all"><img decoding="async" id="n2-ss-3item5" alt="person image" class="skip-lazy" style="width:100px;height:90px" loading="lazy" data-skip-lazy="1" src="//raadrecruitment.ae/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Male-01.png" /></div></div><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-KHm88jWimC0c" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div id="n2-ss-3item6" class="n2-font-b77b80bbaf8ee8b18ad5234bcba03fe7-hover n2-style-b0eb591498834a1e131eda9c9265d3d2-heading   n2-ss-item-content n2-ss-text n2-ow" style="display:block;">David Jones, CEO</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-slide-duration="0" data-id="7" data-slide-public-id="3" aria-hidden="true" data-title="Slide" class="n2-ss-slide n2-ow  n2-ss-slide-7"><div role="note" class="n2-ss-slide--focus" tabindex="-1">Slide</div><div class="n2-ss-layers-container n2-ss-slide-limiter n2-ow"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-uth6VdIFD53M" data-sstype="slide" data-pm="default"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-8K96Po2zQWZw" data-pm="default" data-sstype="content" data-hasbackground="1"><div class="n2-ss-section-main-content n2-ss-layer-with-background n2-ss-layer-content n2-ow n-uc-8K96Po2zQWZw-inner"><div class="n2-ss-layer n2-ow n-uc-lfnGrZEs3zd7" data-pm="normal" data-sstype="layer"><div class="n2-ss-item-content n2-ss-text n2-ow-all"><div class=""><p class="n2-font-48ca1d67608e07a2ee6350a1d5e3fbd2-paragraph   ">&#8220;It&#8217;s difficult to find the right talent in the current market but Raad&#8217;s extensive recruitment services exceeded expectations. Their industry knowledge, combined with screening, resulted in highly qualified candidates. I&#8217;m impressed by their professionalism and dedication to finding the best fit.&#8221;</p>
